{'symbol': 'L', 'date': '2022-02-08 11:22:00', 'title': 'LOEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "NEW YORK, FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOEWS CORPORATION (NYSE: L) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE DECLARATION OF THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.0625 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE MARCH 8, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 23, 2022. LOEWS CORPORATION IS A DIVERSIFIED COMPANY WITH BUSINESSES IN THE INSURANCE, ENERGY, HOSPITALITY, AND PACKAGING INDUSTRIES."}